Package: citadel-helper
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, nftables, iproute2, polkitd | policykit-1, systemd
Description: root helper for the Citadel outbound firewall
 A small, strictly validating root helper (called through pkexec) that turns
 Citadel's per-app policies into one nftables table, restores them at boot,
 and closes only the calling user's own connections. Members of the sudo
 group can use it without a password prompt.
